{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38981","headline":"和友人见题山居水阁八韵 · 杜荀鹤","name":"和友人见题山居水阁八韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"池阁初成眼豁开，眼前霁景属微才。\n试攀檐果猨先见，才把渔竿鹤即来。\n修竹已多犹可种，艳花虽少不劳栽。\n南昌一榻延徐孺，楚国千锺逼老莱。\n未称执鞭奔紫陌，惟宜策杖步苍苔。\n笼禽岂是摩霄翼，润木元非涧下材。\n鉴己每将天作镜，陶情常以海爲杯。\n和君诗句吟声大，虫豸闻之谓蛰雷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38981.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38981","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}